Boot ROM / T2 verifies its own iBoot \uc0\u8594  verifies Intel UEFI firmware \u8594  then UEFI firmware boots macOS.{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://support.apple.com/guide/security/boot-process-sec5d0fab7c6/web?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}}{\fldrslt 
