\fs18 \cf9 \cb10 Apple Support\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cf11 \cb10 +1}}\
\ls84\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
iBoot verifies kernels; no unsigned garbage gets to run as an OS unless the chain says so.\
