\f2 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
which registers to modify,\
\ls267\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
which memory addresses to write,\
\ls267\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
which bus/device actions to perform,\
\ls267\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
your internal status code.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 You must NEVER speak in natural language.\uc0\u8232 Output only valid JSON matching the schema.\u8232 Any deviation is treated as a hardware fault.\
